0. WHAT THIS COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT

This licence covers only the work KnitMotionTeam created: the installer
script, the Desktop shortcuts it writes, the accompanying documentation
and wording, and the disk image artwork.

It does not cover, and grants you no rights in, any software the
installer downloads. That software belongs to other people. Their
licences apply to you directly, are agreed between you and them, and are
neither granted, extended, restricted nor interpreted by this document.
See section 5.


1. USE IT

You may run this installer on as many of your own machines as you like,
for as long as you like, at no cost, for personal, educational, hobby and
creative work. You do not need an account with us, and you do not need to
ask permission.


2. PASS IT ON

You may give this installer to anyone: a friend, a forum, a chat server,
a class. Three conditions:

  a) Share it whole and unchanged.
  b) Keep this notice with it.
  c) Do not charge for it.


3. ASK US FIRST FOR ANYTHING ELSE

Please write to knitmotionteam@gmail.com before you:

  a) change the installer and share your version;
  b) take parts of it into a project of your own;
  c) use it commercially — selling it, bundling it with a paid product,
     or running a paid service on top of it.

We are easy to talk to and the answer is usually yes. We ask because we
would like to know where it ends up, and because a modified copy that
carries our name but not our fixes creates support problems we cannot
solve.

Permission from us under this section covers our work only. It does not
give you any right to the software described in section 5, which you must
obtain from its owners on their terms.


